      "reason": "The original report has all three clauses true and explicitly finds no successful pre-run solution, but then applies the >=50% pre-run override backward. Source inspection confirms that defense cannot be pre-committed: a raid spawns before its response band opens, a lane MARCH is accepted only within that band, and an incorrect or absent defense is fatal for the L1 three-HP queen. The phase-dependent visible lane choice is an expiring opportunity. Change No to Yes and correct the contradictory final sentence; retain the existing witnesses.",
