        },
        {
          "field": [
            "pre_run",
            "reason"
          ],
          "before": "Preparation can gather seeds and raise soldiers, but the only defensive commitment is an outcome-affecting MARCH action. The browser and grader accept NORTH/SOUTH only when the current tick is in the response band 223-268, after the autonomous raid has already spawned and begun moving; there is no queued or pre-commit defense action. Thus no screenshot-only instance can start the autonomous raid outcome phase and send no further outcome-affecting action until that phase ends. The pre-run threshold therefore overrides the mathematical witness and makes the configuration label no.",
          "after": "Preparation can gather seeds and raise soldiers, but the only defensive commitment is an outcome-affecting MARCH action. The browser and grader accept NORTH/SOUTH only when the current tick is in the response band 223-268, after the autonomous raid has already spawned and begun moving; there is no queued or pre-commit defense action. Thus no screenshot-only instance can start the autonomous raid outcome phase and send no further outcome-affecting action until that phase ends. The pre-run threshold is therefore not met and does not override the three-clause real-time witness. This configuration is labelled yes."
